# Tmux Coding Assistant - Server List
# FORMAT: display_name | user | local_ip | tailscale_ip
# - local_ip:     used when on the same LAN (leave blank to always use Tailscale)
# - tailscale_ip: used as fallback when local is unreachable (leave blank if not using Tailscale)
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Whitespace around | is trimmed.
# Copy this file to servers.conf and fill in your real values.

home-server  | root | 192.168.1.100 | 100.x.x.x
work-server  | root | 10.0.0.50     |
